@startuml
title Make Reservation

|Customer|
|Application|
|Payment Gateway|

|Customer|
start
:Select Car and Dates;

|Application|
:Check Car Availability;

if (Is Car Available?) then (Yes)
  |Customer|
  :Review Details;
  
  if (Add Optional Features?) then (Yes)
    :Select Extra Features;
  else (No)
  endif
  
  :Enter Payment Details;

  :Confirm Reservation;
  
  |Application|
  :Initiate Payment;
  
  |Payment Gateway|
  :Process Transaction;
  
  if (Payment Success?) then (Yes)
    
    fork
      |Application|
      :Create Reservation Record;

    fork again
      |Application|
      :Send Confirmation Email;

    end fork
    
    |Application|
    :Generate Final Confirmation;
    
    |Customer|
    :Receive Success Message;
    
  else (No)
    |Application|
    :Generate Payment Error;
    |Customer|
    :Receive Error Notification;
  endif

else (No)
  |Application|
  :Generate Availability Error;
  |Customer|
  :Receive Error Notification;
endif

stop

@enduml